    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "40e36b56094641b11790": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "8039d6554dcd4c197e89": "Greetings.  Do you seek instruction in art of war?",
        "a6a564f5bd9e66bc8680": "I require warrior training.",
        "df7d769174316956a0dc": "I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child.  I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself."
      },
      "name": "Alyissia",
      "subName": "Warrior Trainer",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
